iv class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="15" width="80" height="50" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="40" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">143(3)</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Order</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Stage 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Appeal + Stay + Penalty Defence</h3><p class="step-description">File Form 35 appeal to CIT(A)/NFAC within 30 days. Apply for stay on 20% payment. Defend against S.270A penalty. Track through hearing to final order. Escalate to ITAT if needed.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Appeal filed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Stay granted</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="60" rx="8" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M52 40l5 5 12-12" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Resolved</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>

